Model "control_loop".

"control_loop" is an object [role: system, name: control_loop].
"control_loop" consists of "ec0".
"control_loop" consists of "motor0".
"control_loop" consists of "robot0".
"control_loop" consists of "sensor0".
"control_loop" exhibits "follow0".

"ec0" is an object [role: ec, id: core://core/execution_context/ec0::main_loop_ec, name: ec0, type: main_loop_ec, rate: 20].
"ec0" can be stopped or started.
"ec0" is initially started.

"ec0 cycle" is a process [role: ec_cycle].
"ec0 cycle" occurs if "ec0" is started, otherwise "ec0 cycle" is skipped.
"ec0 cycle" invokes "follow0" [order: 0].
"ec0 cycle" invokes itself.

"follow0" is a process [role: container_process, id: core://core/container_process/follow0::follow_target:robot0, name: follow0, type: follow_target, use_memo: false].
"follow0" affects "robot0".
"follow0" yields "follow0 out".
"follow0" requires "follow0 target" [arg: target, arg_index: 0].

"follow0 out" is an object [role: value, value_kind: output].

"follow0 target" is an object [role: value, value_kind: input, default: 1.0].

"follow_target" is a process [role: composite, type: follow_target].
"follow_target" zooms into "follow_target body.velocity.measured", "follow_target body.velocity", and "follow_target body", in that sequence, as well as "follow_target body.velocity out", "follow_target body.velocity.gain", "follow_target body.velocity.measured out", "follow_target motor", and "follow_target sensor".

"follow_target body" is a process [role: node, type: dummy_motor_drive, path: body].
"follow_target body" affects "follow_target motor".
"follow_target body" yields "follow_target out".
"follow_target body" requires "follow_target body.velocity out" [arg: velocity, arg_index: 0].

"follow_target body.velocity" is a process [role: node, type: p_control, path: body.velocity].
"follow_target body.velocity" yields "follow_target body.velocity out".
"follow_target body.velocity" requires "follow_target body.velocity.gain" [arg: gain, arg_index: 2].
"follow_target body.velocity" requires "follow_target body.velocity.measured out" [arg: measured, arg_index: 0].
"follow_target body.velocity" requires "follow_target target" [arg: target, arg_index: 1].

"follow_target body.velocity out" is an object [role: value, value_kind: intermediate].

"follow_target body.velocity.gain" is an object [role: value, value_kind: const, value: 2.0].

"follow_target body.velocity.measured" is a process [role: node, type: dummy_sensor_read, path: body.velocity.measured].
"follow_target body.velocity.measured" affects "follow_target sensor".
"follow_target body.velocity.measured" yields "follow_target body.velocity.measured out".

"follow_target body.velocity.measured out" is an object [role: value, value_kind: intermediate].

"follow_target motor" is an object [role: slot, name: motor, type: dummy_motor].

"follow_target out" is an object [role: value, value_kind: output].

"follow_target sensor" is an object [role: slot, name: sensor, type: dummy_sensor].

"follow_target target" is an object [role: value, name: target, value_kind: input].

"motor0" is an object [role: container, id: core://core/container/motor0::dummy_motor, name: motor0, type: dummy_motor].

"robot0" is an object [role: composite_container, id: core://core/container/robot0::composite_container, name: robot0].
"robot0" consists of "motor0" [slot_name: motor].
"robot0" consists of "sensor0" [slot_name: sensor].

"sensor0" is an object [role: container, id: core://core/container/sensor0::dummy_sensor, name: sensor0, type: dummy_sensor].
